Description: glass file manager for Hyprland in Qt 6 / QML
 Shelf is a simple file manager for Hyprland styled after glassmorphism: a
 frosted-glass window blurred by the compositor, a hand-drawn glass icon set
 and smooth animations. It takes its palette from matugen or a Quickshell bar
 (or uses built-in light and dark themes) and recolors itself when the
 wallpaper changes.
 .
 Tabs, drag and drop, trash with restore, thumbnails, "open with" and a
 first-run setup that checks the environment.
